Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; MajorGeeks.Com
; https://www.majorgeeks.com/content/page/disable_bsod_auto_restart.html
: Tutorial: How to Enable or Disable Blue Screen of Death (BSOD) Auto Restart in Windows 10

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\CrashControl]
"AutoReboot"=dword:00000000


